hould-you-live-in/','Hack Housing: Which Columbia dorm should you live in?','https://arc-anglerfish-arc2-prod-spectator.s3.amazonaws.com/public/M5NQVWKLAFBBXLFY673KIN3NEQ','Veronica Grace Taleon','Mar 21, 2017'),('https://www.columbiaspectator.com/spectrum/2017/03/21/hack-housing-which-dorms-are-the-quietest-on-campus/','Hack Housing: Which dorms are the quietest on campus?','https://arc-anglerfish-arc2-prod-spectator.s3.amazonaws.com/public/GDS6DWLRM5GMPJCMC62AQBLMQM','Sein An','Mar 21, 2017'),('https://www.columbiaspectator.com/spectrum/2017/03/23/hack-housing-barnard-senior-selection-preview/','Hack Housing: Barnard senior selection preview','https://arc-anglerfish-arc2-prod-spectator.s3.amazonaws.com/public/PAPKVJGXO5BJ5DUNGCERUO4HGI','Veronica Grace Taleon','Mar 23, 2017'),('https://www.columbiaspectator.com/spectrum/2017/03/24/hack-housing-which-dorms-are-the-loudest-on-campus/','Hack Housing: Which dorms are the loudest on campus?','https://arc-anglerfish-arc2-prod-spectator.s3.amazonaws.com/public/W75FLR3G3BDKVCKEXYWA6GHK5I','Isabella Monaco','Mar 24, 2017'),('https://www.columbiaspectator.com/spectrum/2017/03/30/hack-housing-which-dorms-and-floors-have-been-renovated-at-columbia-and-barnard/','Hack Housing: Which dorms and floors have been renovated at Columbia and Barnard?','https://arc-anglerfish-arc2-prod-spectator.s3.amazonaws.com/public/ZOYMVWGRWFCMBLOU7F56MTTONI','Jackie Hajdenberg','Mar 29, 2017'),('https://www.columbiaspectator.com/spectrum/2017/03/31/hack-housing-columbia-senior-selection-preview/','Hack Housing: Columbia senior selection preview','https://arc-anglerfish-arc2-prod-spectator.s3.amazonaws.com/public/BYLNPGAHANBGDNYBU76IY4GMIQ','Huber Gonzales','Mar 31, 2017'),('https://www.columbiaspectator.com/spectrum/2022/04/15/columbia-dorm-tours-broadway-hall/','Columbia dorm tours: Broadway Hall','https://cloudfront-us-east-1.images.arcpublishing.com/spectator/PDGH4QRUIZE3ZCTMZ3HA5OSBQM.png','Ava Frisina and Haley Long','Apr 24, 2022');
